--- !u!114 &2031995538
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2031995536}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6a217d28a45e7e44cac46a3b3ba49be3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueControl
  text: {fileID: 886430344}
  dialogueLines:
  - Welcome to the Han Dynasty! Find the librarian, Click OK on the controller and
    he will tell you what you need to know. You can press button A on you controller
    at any time to go to the present that is altered by you decisions.
  - Find the Bathouse and steal a minister's cloth. You can press button A on you
    controller at any time to go to the present that is altered by you decisions.
  - "If you see a drunk guy on your way to the palace, you can steal from him. Head
    to the palace gate and if you have completed all your requirements, you will
    get to meet the emperor. Use your \u2018OK\u2019 button to Click on Enter. You
    can press button A on you controller at any time to go to the present that is
    altered by you decisions."
  - Welcome to the palace, talk to the Emperor to learn more about the silk road
    before you make your decision. Use your OK button to make your decision. You
    can press button A on you controller at any time to go to the present that is
    altered by you decisions.
  - Press button A on you controller at any time to go to the present that is altered
    by you decisions.
